  "_doc": "Real-conversation fixtures. 'parsed' is the golden Intent the MODEL should return for the utterance (the model is not run in tests). 'expect.A' is checked now (data model + ask/assume); expect.B..F are the contracts for the next stages and stay pending until those stages are built. Dates: today = 2026-11-15 (Sunday).",
